1
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:23,570
Boss.

2
00:01:27,789 --> 00:01:28,300
Well,

3
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,730
Wen Yanhui is here, Boss.

4
00:01:34,310 --> 00:01:35,150
Got it.

5
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,910
[Dearest: Episode 17]

6
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:53,400
Grandpa, what brings you here?

7
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,760
Today is Alex’s birthday.

8
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:02,870
As an elder,

9
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,920
I have to do something to celebrate.

10
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:07,710
After all, he helped Wen Group.

11
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,240
I prepared a gift in advance.

12
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:15,710
But it seems that
the birthday boy is not here anymore.

13
00:02:16,450 --> 00:02:17,329
I knew it.

14
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,040
No one knows that Jiang Yu is back.

15
00:02:20,579 --> 00:02:21,610
But it's okay.

16
00:02:22,130 --> 00:02:25,329
Well, I suppose this birthday gift
is a memorial gift now.

17
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:30,990
I'll take this gift.

18
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,329
When he comes back in a few days,

19
00:02:33,329 --> 00:02:36,050
I'll ask him to personally thank you.

20
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:37,710
By the way,

21
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:40,150
after the board meeting,

22
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,590
I'll have a big gift for Grandpa too.

23
00:02:43,210 --> 00:02:46,610
Consider it your retirement gift.

24
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:50,750
Okay, let's wait and see.

25
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:23,120
Something is definitely off
about this statue.

26
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,630
I've thought so

27
00:03:24,829 --> 00:03:26,430
ever since it showed up here.

28
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,910
Wen Yanhui is clearly
up to something today.

29
00:03:31,310 --> 00:03:34,310
Let's see what's wrong with this statue.

30
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:35,079
Hao.

31
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:36,310
Smash it.

32
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:53,710
Uncle Long, iced Americano.

33
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:06,220
It's been a while
since I've had something this pure.

34
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:08,320
And you managed to make this from here?

35
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,520
I work with pharmaceuticals,

36
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,760
so the principle is basically the same.

37
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:14,160
I pretended to be sick a while back
and stockpiled some cold medicine.

38
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,420
I extracted some of the compounds from it

39
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,730
and was able to make this.

40
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:20,390
Just a little something I picked up,
Uncle Long.

41
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,390
I know your situation.

42
00:04:28,510 --> 00:04:30,040
You want to get out so badly?

43
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:34,159
Uncle Long, as long as you let me out,

44
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,330
I'm willing to do anything for you.

45
00:04:43,810 --> 00:04:44,500
Uncle Long.

46
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:47,600
With your old connections, your influence,

47
00:04:47,770 --> 00:04:49,010
and my skills,

48
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,310
I'll make you rise again

49
00:04:51,590 --> 00:04:53,120
and reclaim your position.

50
00:04:53,930 --> 00:04:55,530
And maybe reach even higher.

51
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,050
Do you like it, lady?

52
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:21,590
You turned me on,

53
00:05:22,090 --> 00:05:24,220
so you'd better take responsibility.

54
00:05:34,950 --> 00:05:35,870
Lady.

55
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,490
You really know how to play.

56
00:05:38,850 --> 00:05:39,710
Is it exciting?

57
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:46,750
Help! Rape!

58
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,430
Someone raped me!

59
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,830
Help!

60
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,390
Help!

61
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,950
Lady! Lady!

62
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,950
Rape! Rape!

63
00:05:57,250 --> 00:05:59,620
Rape! Rape!

64
00:05:59,650 --> 00:06:01,530
I was raped in Cloudsea.

65
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,000
That's too much.

66
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:04,820
He thought I'm pretty,

67
00:06:04,850 --> 00:06:06,280
dragged me into the toilet

68
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,610
and raped me.

69
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,720
Madam, please calm down.

70
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,530
Cloudsea will
take responsibility for this.

71
00:06:11,530 --> 00:06:12,560
We will make sure you're compensated.

72
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,290
Compensate?

73
00:06:13,290 --> 00:06:14,390
How are you going to compensate me?

74
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,720
How?

75
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:18,160
Do you know what makes me happy?

76
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,950
Murder!

77
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:29,830
Murder!

78
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:32,620
Wen Jianan from Cloudsea killed someone.

79
00:06:37,750 --> 00:06:39,750
What's wrong with Wen Jianan?

80
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:42,720
She's late for such an important occasion.

81
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:46,010
I heard Cloudsea is having some trouble.

82
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:49,320
Dear shareholders,

83
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:53,310
according to the company's bylaws,

84
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:56,750
any candidate who is 30 minutes late

85
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:59,480
it will be deemed
to have withdrawn voluntarily.

86
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:01,710
There are less than five minutes left.

87
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:04,940
I'm afraid candidate Wen Jianan
won't be able to make it.

88
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:06,290
Police have preliminarily confirmed

89
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:13,640
[Suspected body
found inside plaster statue in Cloudsea]

90
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:07,880
that what was found in the bag
was not a human body,

91
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,880
but a clothing mannequin.

92
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:12,290
The case is still under investigation.

93
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,040
Grandpa, I'm here.

94
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:38,640
Five minutes left. I'm not late, am I?

95
00:07:39,570 --> 00:07:40,930
Why are you...

96
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:49,120
The statue Grandpa sent to Cloudsea

97
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:52,080
really had a secret hidden inside.

98
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:55,640
Dear shareholders,

99
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:58,270
I'm here today

100
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:00,360
not only to run for chairman,

101
00:08:01,190 --> 00:08:03,120
but also to expose something.

102
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,920
Candidate Wen Yanhui

103
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,160
attempted to sabotage the election

104
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,610
by killing someone,

105
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,980
hiding the body, and trying to frame me.

106
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:16,430
Murder?

107
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,380
What evidence do you have?

108
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:27,190
The person you killed
and tried to frame me for killing

109
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:29,860
was my biological mother,

110
00:08:30,380 --> 00:08:31,260
Wen Yan.

111
00:08:37,770 --> 00:08:39,960
Didn't the old chairman die long ago?

112
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:40,750
Yes.

113
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:43,730
Chairman Wen Yan is Wen Jianan's mother?

114
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:46,000
How do you explain that?

115
00:08:46,710 --> 00:08:47,640
Nonsense!

116
00:08:48,030 --> 00:08:49,230
Everyone here knows

117
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:51,290
Wen Yan died 20 years ago.

118
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:53,460
Wen Yanhui.

119
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,310
No.

120
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,370
I should call you Chen Hui now.

121
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:05,110
Years ago, just before the board election,

122
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:07,630
you deliberately staged

123
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:10,670
Wen Yan death's as a car accident.

124
00:09:10,810 --> 00:09:12,150
In reality, you kept her locked away

125
00:09:12,150 --> 00:09:14,670
in a dark basement for 20 years.

126
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:16,220
20 years?

127
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,360
This is how

128
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:23,360
you stole the Wen Group from her.

129
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,820
And now, just to take it all for yourself,

130
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:27,250
you killed her again.

131
00:09:31,350 --> 00:09:34,280
Wen Jianan, you are really good
at making up stories.

132
00:09:35,230 --> 00:09:37,710
Do you have proof that I killed Wen Yan?

133
00:09:37,930 --> 00:09:38,840
You are framing me.

134
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,040
This is slander, you know?

135
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:40,680
Fine.

136
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,250
Then I'll show everyone the evidence.

137
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,270
This...

138
00:09:57,650 --> 00:09:58,290
Mom.

139
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,480
Mom!

140
00:10:00,070 --> 00:10:00,760
Mom!

141
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:02,160
Mom!

142
00:10:23,950 --> 00:10:24,740
Chen Hui.

143
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:26,920
Everything you took from her,

144
00:10:27,610 --> 00:10:29,760
I'm taking back now.
